    },
    {
      "section_id": "SEC041",
      "title": "Fighting What Does Not Exist",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "Jesus said something in John chapter 8, speaking to the Jews: you are like your father, the devil. He was a murderer from the beginning; he was a liar from the beginning. When he lies, it is from his nature. When he does evil, it is natural to him — intrinsic, not incidental.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA163",
            "SRC004388",
            "SRC004389",
            "SRC004391",
            "SRC004393",
            "SRC004394",
            "SRC004397",
            "SRC004398",
            "SRC004401",
            "SRC004402"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC004388",
            "SRC004389",
            "SRC004391",
            "SRC004393",
            "SRC004394",
            "SRC004397",
            "SRC004398",
            "SRC004401",
            "SRC004402"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA163"
          ],
          "example_refs": [],
          "reference_refs": [],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000012",
          "provider_handle": "p12"
        },
        {
          "text": "Know this: Lucifer is not the devil. Lucifer cannot be the devil, because Lucifer did not keep from the beginning — he is not a liar from the beginning, and he is not a murderer from the beginning. When next we meet, I will give you the doctrine of the devil.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA164",
            "SRC004404",
            "SRC004405",
            "SRC004408",
            "SRC004409",
            "SRC004414",
            "SRC004415",
            "SRC004416",
            "SRC004417",
            "SRC004420"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC004404",
            "SRC004405",
            "SRC004408",
            "SRC004409",
            "SRC004414",
            "SRC004415",
            "SRC004416",
            "SRC004417",
            "SRC004420"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA164"
          ],
          "example_refs": [],
          "reference_refs": [],
          "uncertainty_refs": [
            "UNC018"
          ],
          "paragraph_id": "P000013",
          "provider_handle": "p13"
        },
        {
          "text": "Many of you do not know devil and do not know Lucifer — you treat all of them as the same thing, and then you put Satan inside as well. That is why some of your spiritual warfare does not go anywhere: you are fighting something that doesn't exist.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA165",
            "SRC004424",
            "SRC004425",
            "SRC004426",
            "SRC004427",
            "SRC004428",
            "SRC004429"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC004424",
            "SRC004425",
            "SRC004426",
            "SRC004427",
            "SRC004428",
            "SRC004429"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA165"
          ],
          "example_refs": [],
          "reference_refs": [],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000014",
          "provider_handle": "p14"
        }
      ],
      "idea_refs": [
        "IDEA163",
        "IDEA164",
        "IDEA165"
      ],
